| `traceability.id_prefixes[].prefix` | string | `REQ-` | upper-case ASCII words, each a letter then letters or digits, each followed by one dash (`REQ-`, `REQ-SELF-`); no prefix listed twice | `scripts/traceability.py` (`load_policy`) | Adds or renames an id prefix; an id whose prefix no row lists is refused, and the longest listed prefix an id starts with is the only one it is read under. | the number of digits after it: `traceability.id_prefixes[].digits` | always |
